    {
      "id": "claim_159a744596934ad797a087569e860500",
      "statement": "Evidence age uses the tighter policy and evidence staleness bound, rejects future observations, and applies environment-specific trust: validating nodes and cross-checked providers are accepted everywhere, a single provider is rejected on mainnet, and a development simulator is accepted only in dev.",
