    {
      "id": "claim_bae801b9ca834bd3a08a6e33086f71b9",
      "statement": "The kernel checks each rolling limit against an exact asset/window exposure entry using checked `settled + outstanding + max(decoded amount, claimed outflows)` arithmetic; absent data or overflow denies, and equality with the maximum is allowed.",
